# Taxi Backend (Node + TypeScript)

## Setup
```bash
cd taxi-backend
copy .env.example .env
npm install
docker compose up -d
```

## Init DB
```bash
docker exec -i taxi_postgres psql -U postgres -d taxi_viktor < sql/001_init.sql
npm run db:seed
```

## Run
```bash
npm run dev
```

## Endpoints
- GET /health
- POST /auth/register-client
- POST /auth/login
- POST /auth/refresh
- POST /rides
- GET /rides/:id
